    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ary Moore Property Ltd., is delighted to the Sales Market this beautiful 3 bedroom detached dormer bungalow with study. This bright, spacious brick fronted home is located at the end of the cul-de-sac and is not overlooked back or front. It has ample space to the side for future development. The rear garden enjoys the sun from 10 a.m. to 8 p.m. from May to September. Griffin Rath Manor is a small, exclusive estate with a wealth of amenities on its doorstep. There are 3 schools on the road. The bus stop is 2 minutes walk with the C.4 and C.6 bus running 23/7 to and from Dublin City! The W.6 goes directly to Maynooth Community College. The new road beside Lidl will lead directly onto the N.4 and the planned ring road will link to the other side of Maynooth which needs no introduction! A vibrant University town with a spectacular array of shops, restaurants, train station, schools and of course INTEL!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\r\nBright spacious hallway with cream porcelain floor, cream radiator cover, glass panel door with full length lights on each side, sockets with vdouble height atrium with Velux window to front.\r\n\r\nLounge:\r\nLarge bay window, centre light fitting, fireplace with stove, timber flooring, french doors leading to dining room.\r\n\r\nDining Room:\r\nTimber floor, french doors leading to patio area.\r\n\r\nFamily Room/4th Bedroom:\r\nLarge room to the front with bay window, timber floor.\r\n\r\nEnsuite Shower:\r\nShower stall, toilet, sink, vanity, porcelain tiled floor, partially tiled wall, light fitting.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\nLarge eat-in kitchen, painted shaker kitchen, 3 windows, porcelain floors, pendant light fitting, spot lights.\r\n\r\nUtility:\r\nPlumbed for washing machine, dryer, storage cabinet, half glass door leading side passageway.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\nLarge room to the front, painted white floors, large bank of cream wardrobes, curtains and curtain rail.\r\nEnsuite:\r\nBath, toilet, ceramic floor, sink.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nGray laminate floor, window to the front.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\nVelux window to rear of the property, laminate floor.\r\n\r\nShower room:\r\nShower stall, ceramic tiled floor, sink, toilet.\r\n\r\nTimber Shed."
      },
